            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Ca Ba Phien",
            "review_text": "Raymondale\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia1361 contributions\n0\ngrilled fish cake vermicelli\nSep 2019\nit is famous,i found it from somebody's travelogue,so decided to have dinner here.i ordered the signature bun cha ca,also lemonade.i am a big eater,think the portion of bun cha ca not big,the taste was fine,sour sweet taste.just okay for me.the noodles soup was fine,not too heavy.you can add herbs and veggies into the bowl.before making payment, found that they have home made yogurt,bought one,and had it when back to my hotel.oh,the yogurt was great! so five stars go for the yogurt.should buy more cup back. anyway,the price here is ok,will come again,and may try other bun cha,of course buy more yogurt!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 30, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
